    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;One More Level&gt;&gt;is a relaxed and enjoyable tower breaking game, which not only has a rich equipment system but also various fascinating storylines, Various random events are irresistible, and if you are a game enthusiast, it will be a blessing for you. Playing it will make you addicted!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u3001Rich equipment system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, each piece of equipment not only has exclusive special effects, but also a star rating system similar to that of a heavy mech soldier, which gives a great sense of achievement when it comes to obtaining three-star equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/76a22e258143b0f54eaa28d89923608d.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/cca1fae3f3cd894eb3fd3ed10e7c679e.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u3001Innovative reinforcement system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can collect strengthening stones to create your own unique equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/79354309d3bc8908329a10185921760c.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/321a035cf5970fd40333013550fe58e2.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u3001Colorful synthesis system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can collect various materials to synthesize various props and equipment that are beneficial for battles, making adventures easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/d1fedb74b303861c3f4cd85bdb97737e.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/8522bf209ba94f8582ec39ce015fb6cd.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\u3001Exciting exchange system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can collect various rare items such as dragon crystals to exchange for super rare items, which brings a great sense of happiness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/659f5abeb43d75898745315fa13af595.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u3001 Author's words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the above gameplay, there are dozens of exciting gameplay options in the game. Come and experience them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6\u3001 Official communication group</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further official communication group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1012236174</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;One More Level&gt;&gt;is a relaxed and enjoyable tower breaking game, which not only has a rich equipment system but also various fascinating storylines, Various random events are irresistible, and if you are a game enthusiast, it will be a blessing for you. Playing it will make you addicted!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u3001Rich equipment system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, each piece of equipment not only has exclusive special effects, but also a star rating system similar to that of a heavy mech soldier, which gives a great sense of achievement when it comes to obtaining three-star equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/76a22e258143b0f54eaa28d89923608d.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/cca1fae3f3cd894eb3fd3ed10e7c679e.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u3001Innovative reinforcement system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can collect strengthening stones to create your own unique equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/79354309d3bc8908329a10185921760c.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/321a035cf5970fd40333013550fe58e2.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u3001Colorful synthesis system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can collect various materials to synthesize various props and equipment that are beneficial for battles, making adventures easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/d1fedb74b303861c3f4cd85bdb97737e.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/8522bf209ba94f8582ec39ce015fb6cd.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\u3001Exciting exchange system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can collect various rare items such as dragon crystals to exchange for super rare items, which brings a great sense of happiness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/659f5abeb43d75898745315fa13af595.avif?t=1750396733\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u3001 Author's words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the above gameplay, there are dozens of exciting gameplay options in the game. Come and experience them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6\u3001 Official communication group</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further official communication group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1012236174</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
